      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, Arabic address",
          "value": "<p>To my lord and master, Abu\u0304 Ya\u2018qu\u0304b Yu\u0304suf ibn \u2018Ali\u0304 al-Fa\u0304si\u0304.</p>\n<p>May God lengthen his remaining [days] and make permanent his well-being and happiness.</p>\n<p>From Nahray ibn Nissim, with thanks to him.</p>\n<p>[Send to] Tyre, God willing.</p>\n<p>Al-H\u0323usayn ibn \u2018Abd al-Rah\u0323man, Ibrah\u012bm ibn Naj\u0101, and his son.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
